//│ ╟── Cannot resolve member 'key' of a value with unknown shape.
//│ ╟── Cannot infer the type arguments of 'Array' without a known 'Array' type.
//│ ║  l.161: 	fun head[B](xs: Array[B]): B = xs.0
//│ ║         	                ^^^^^^^^
//│ ╟── The available type information comes from this annotation.
//│ ║  l.162: 	fun erasedAny(xs: Any) = head(xs)
